ound:#dde0e3;font-weight:600;text-align:center;color:#111827;">내용</th><th style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;background:#dde0e3;font-weight:600;text-align:center;color:#111827;">기타</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan="1" style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;">2026-05-11(월)</td><td style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;">사내</td><td style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;">ABZ+</td><td style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;"><div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">[ABZ+] 인증서 만료 점검 스크립트 작성 및 공유</div><div>1) 웹 서버 인증서 만료일을 모아 보는 스크립트(cert_check.sh) 작성</div><div style="margin-left:8px;">- 서버 목록 csv를 읽어 남은 일수를 한 줄씩 출력</div><div style="margin-left:16px;color:#6B7280;">&gt; 사용방법 : ./cert_check.sh servers.csv --days 30</div><div style="margin-left:16px;color:#6B7280;">&gt; 30일 이하로 남은 서버만 따로 표시</div><div>2) 만료 임박 서버 목록 공유</div><div style="margin-left:8px;">- 이번 달 안에 갱신이 필요한 서버 3대 목록 전달</div><div style="height:10px;"></div><div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;">[ABZ+] 백업 검증 절차 정리</div><div>1) 주간 백업 복원 시험 절차 문서화</div><div style="margin-left:8px;">- 복원 대상·소요 시간·확인 항목을 표로 정리</div><div style="margin-left:16px;color:#6B7280;">&gt; 복원 시험은 매주 수요일 오전에 진행</div></td><td style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:top;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;">　</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;font-variant-ligatures:none;">2026-05-12(화)</td><td style="border:1px solid #b7bcc2;padding:8px 10px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;font-family:'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', '맑은 고딕', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1f2937;word-b